			(opp. agrestis, silvestris, etc., that grows wild; very rare), Varr.
			ap. <i><span class="en">Gell.
				17, 3, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">morus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
