			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					32, 2, 11, § 22</span></i>
			.—<i>Neutr. plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sativa (opp. silvestria),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 12, 60, § 185</span></i>
			.</div>
